# Benchmark artifact hygiene.
# Intermediate + stub run artifacts are REGENERATED (not source) — ignore them.
# But the FINAL, citable reports (*.md) are committed into the repo so the
# published result is versioned + reviewable. See per-line rules below.

__pycache__/
*.pyc
specs/

# --- results/: ignore generated intermediates, KEEP final reports + provenance ---
*/results/*
# un-ignore the citable outputs (negations must come AFTER the broad rule):
!*/results/.gitkeep
!*/results/PROVENANCE.md
!*/results/*.md
# belt-and-suspenders: never commit stub/eval intermediates even if *.md-adjacent
*/results/*.eval-results-stub
*/results/*.jsonl
*/results/*_hyp.jsonl.log
